Package: cuems-nodeconf
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>
Installed-Size: 119
Depends: cuems-utils (>= 0.1.0rc4), cuems-common (>= 1.0.0), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-netifaces, python3-zeroconf, python3-dbus, python3-systemd (>= 235)
Section: python
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/cuems/cuems-nodeconf
Description: CUEMS Node Configuration - Node configuration and network management
 CUEMS Node Configuration provides network discovery, node adoption,
 and configuration management for CUEMS nodes. It handles Avahi/Zeroconf
 service discovery, network interface management, and node-to-controller
 communication.
 .
 This package installs into the /usr/lib/cuems/ virtual environment
 provided by cuems-utils. Console script is installed to
 /usr/lib/cuems/bin/cuems-nodeconf.
 .
 The systemd service file is provided by cuems-common and runs the
 cuems-nodeconf console script.
